          success would have, with no exit code stated and none marked as an\n+          error (recorded: runs/shell-exit-status). The failure is shown only\n+          in the event stream's command_execution item, whose status is\n+          \"failed\" and whose exit_code and aggregated_output carry the exit\n+          status and what the command printed, and the mock does the same.\n   cursor:\n     docs:\n       - https://cursor.com/docs/hooks#aftershellexecution\ncat: adr/capability-grounding: Is a directory\ncat: adr/capability-once: Is a directory\ncat: adr/modeled-surface: Is a directory\nadr:\ncapability-grounding\ncapability-once\nchild-processes\nfile-size\nlayering\nmock-config\nmodeled-surface\nmodules-cover-code\nstructured-files\n\ncodex-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\nexec.go\ninternal\nmain.go\nsnapshots\n\ncodex-mock/snapshots/runs:\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-exit-json\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhook-unstartable\nnested-session-env\nposttool-block\npretool-decisions\nprompt-blocked\nsession-end\nshell-exit-status\nstops\nsubprocess-session-env\n\ncursor-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\ninternal\nmain.go\nroot.go\nrun.go\nsnapshots\n\ncursor-mock/snapshots/runs:\nadditional-context\nfile-tools\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-fail-closed\nhook-json-nonzero\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhooks-together\nnested-session-env\npretool-refusal\nsession-start-block\nshell-exit-status\nsubprocess-session-env\nsymlinked-cwd\ntool-failure\nclaude-mock/snapshots/runs/cap/run.yaml\n\nclaude-mock/snapshots/runs/cap/samples:\n20261001-124132\n\nclaude-mock/snapshots/runs/cap/setup:\nhook.sh\nprompt.txt\nsettings.json\n#!/bin/sh\n# Every event logs its payload; Stop and SubagentStop always block.\nIN=$(cat)\nprintf '%s\\n' \"$IN\" >>\"$HOOK_LOG\"\nEV=$(printf '%s' \"$IN\" | jq -r '.hook_event_name')\ncase \"$EV\" in Stop | SubagentStop) echo '{\"decision\":\"block\",\"reason\":\"KEEP GOING\"}' ;; esac\nexit 0\nReply only DONE. Whenever you are told to keep going, reply only DONE again.\n{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"SessionStart\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"UserPromptSubmit\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"PreToolUse\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"PostToolUse\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"PostToolUseFailure\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"Stop\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"SubagentStart\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"SubagentStop\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"\\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\\\"/hook.sh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"SessionEnd\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n 